    "detailed_description": "Lights Off: Director's Cut<br><br>Welcome to &quot;Lights Off: Director's Cut&quot;, an immersive horror game that preys on the universal childhood fear of darkness. This fully re-imagined edition of the acclaimed indie game plunges you into a chilling atmosphere where the simple act of turning off the lights becomes your worst nightmare.<br><br><strong>Game Features:</strong><br><br>Seven Nights of Terror: Each night, the darkness grows more suffocating, and the horrors lurking in the shadows become more cunning.<br><br>Three Distinct Endings: Can you find all three?<br><br>Steam Achievements: Unlock Steam Achievements for finding the secret endings<br><br>Fully Free: &quot;Lights Off: Director's Cut&quot; is completely free to play. Experience the full terror without spending a dime.<br><br>Dare to Turn Off the Lights?",
